{
  "type": "l298",
  "name": "Dual H-bridge L298",
  "category": "Motors & motion",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Dual full bridge for motors (L298): with ENA high, OUT1 follows IN1 and OUT2 follows IN2 (high: to VS, low: to SENSA), likewise ENB, IN3, IN4 and OUT3, OUT4; an enable low lets its outputs float (PWM on the enables sets the speed). About 1.3 ohm per switch, 2.6 V lost at 1 A; logic supply 5 V on VSS, motor supply up to 46 V on VS; tie SENSA and SENSB to GND or through sense resistors. No internal flyback diodes: add them, as the datasheet says",
